      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "They do not notice the change at first while fighting wolf groups and recovering with a planted primeval stone hill. When the speckles become denser and seriously affect them, they come to their senses, but it is already too late. Pan Ping dies first; several days later Chang Biao also dies from exhaustion in that battle.",
